{"seq":17,"slug":"differential-equations","title":"微分方程","stage":"DONE","category":"mathematics-statistics","chapterCount":5,"docCount":16,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/differential-equations","rating":{"composite":4.01,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"微分方程-描述变化规律的数学语言\">微分方程：描述变化规律的数学语言</h1><h2 id=\"定位与边界\">定位与边界</h2><p>微分方程是含有未知函数及其导数的方程——它的解是函数而非数，描述的是变化率之间的关系。从行星轨道到种群增长，从热量扩散到电流振荡，自然界中无数变化现象都最自然地由微分方程刻画，它是连接数学与现实世界的核心桥梁，被誉为&quot;应用数学的心脏&quot;。与同类数学 hub 的边界：「微积分应用」提供导数与积分的基本工具，本 hub 将这些工具用于建立和求解描述动态系统的方程；「数值方法」第四章专门讲如何用计算机数值求解本 hub 研究的方程；「非线性动力学与混沌」则是本 hub 第四章定性分析的深入延伸。</p>\n<h2 id=\"学习路径\">学习路径</h2><p>本 hub 共五章，从基础概念到高阶理论再到广泛应用逐层递进：</p>\n<p><strong>第一章 基础与分类</strong>——界定微分方程的含义（解是函数、描述变化规律）、常微分方程与偏微分方程的根本区分、阶与线性等分类方式，以及通解与定解条件的概念。</p>\n<p><strong>第二章 一阶常微分方程</strong>——讲解方向场的几何视角、可分离变量方程、一阶线性方程与积分因子，以及存在唯一性理论。这是后续所有解法的技术基础。</p>\n<p><strong>第三章 高阶与线性常微分方程</strong>——剖析叠加原理、常系数齐次方程的特征方程解法、&quot;自由响应+受迫响应&quot;结构，以及振动与共振的物理意义。</p>\n<p><strong>第四章 微分方程组与定性分析</strong>——从单个方程扩展到多变量耦合系统，从求解转向定性分析：相平面、稳定性判断与混沌的初步介绍。</p>\n<p><strong>第五章 偏微分方程与应用</strong>——进入偏微分方程领域：三类经典方程（热传导、波动、Laplace）、数值方法概述，并纵览微分方程在物理、工程、生物、经济中的广泛应用。</p>\n<p>建议按章节顺序阅读。始终把握一条主线：微分方程把&quot;变化的规律&quot;转化为可求解、可预测的数学问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li>微积分基础：导数（含偏导数）、积分、Taylor 展开</li>\n<li>线性代数基础：矩阵运算、特征值（第四章需要）</li>\n<li>基本的物理直觉有助于理解应用场景，但非必需</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"../numerical-methods/\">数值方法</a>——当解析解不可得时，如何用计算机数值求解微分方程</li>\n<li><a href=\"../nonlinear-dynamics-chaos/\">非线性动力学与混沌</a>——第四章定性分析的深入延伸</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础与分类","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/differential-equations/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-is-a-differential-equation","title":"什么是微分方程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/differential-equations/foundations/what-is-a-differential-equation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ode-vs-pde","title":"常微分方程与偏微分方程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/differential-equations/foundations/ode-vs-pde"},{"seq":3,"slug":"order-linearity-solutions","title":"阶、线性与解","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/differential-equations/foundations/order-linearity-solutions"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"first-order-ode","title":"一阶常微分方程","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/differential-equations/first-order-ode","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"direction-fields","title":"方向场","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/differential-equations/first-order-ode/direction-fields"},{"seq":2,"slug":"separable-equations","title":"可分离变量方程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/differential-equations/first-order-ode/separable-equations"},{"seq":3,"slug":"linear-equations-existence","title":"一阶线性方程与存在唯一性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/differential-equations/first-order-ode/linear-equations-existence"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"higher-order-linear","title":"高阶与线性常微分方程","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/differential-equations/higher-order-linear","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"superposition","title":"叠加原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/differential-equations/higher-order-linear/superposition"},{"seq":2,"slug":"characteristic-equation","title":"特征方程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/differential-equations/higher-order-linear/characteristic-equation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"forced-response-resonance","title":"受迫响应与共振","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/differential-equations/higher-order-linear/forced-response-resonance"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"systems-and-qualitative","title":"微分方程组与定性分析","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/differential-equations/systems-and-qualitative","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"systems-of-equations","title":"微分方程组","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/differential-equations/systems-and-qualitative/systems-of-equations"},{"seq":2,"slug":"qualitative-analysis","title":"从求解到定性分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/differential-equations/systems-and-qualitative/qualitative-analysis"},{"seq":3,"slug":"stability-and-chaos","title":"稳定性与混沌","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/differential-equations/systems-and-qualitative/stability-and-chaos"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"pde-and-applications","title":"偏微分方程与应用","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/differential-equations/pde-and-applications","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"pde-intro","title":"偏微分方程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/differential-equations/pde-and-applications/pde-intro"},{"seq":2,"slug":"three-classic-equations","title":"三类经典方程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/differential-equations/pde-and-applications/three-classic-equations"},{"seq":3,"slug":"numerical-methods","title":"数值方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/differential-equations/pde-and-applications/numerical-methods"},{"seq":4,"slug":"applications-and-significance","title":"微分方程的应用与意义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/differential-equations/pde-and-applications/applications-and-significance"}]}]}